paseo-seamless-claude-accounts 1.7.0 (9db99b1), for two organizations of one person.

- Only the Claude login moves between config dirs. A dir's MCP OAuth logins and plugin
  secrets stay with it, so a switch neither drops them nor makes them live in two dirs.
- When Anthropic can't be asked, the account block no longer chooses between two
  organizations of one person: it is all that tells them apart, and it can lag a switch.
- "You've hit your monthly spend limit." and "You're out of extra usage" count as limits.

